          "emotion": null,
          "child": "which music do you like",
          "reply": "I really enjoy jazz too! [SHY] It's got that cool, smooth rhythm that just makes everything feel a bit more relaxed. What\u2019s your favorite jazz song or artist? [CURIOUS]"
